  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Inspect the AI-generated web page and identify two or three accessibility issues. Add each issue to the correct POUR category in your [activity guide](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-gOT9aQKoFnJSypCHNDFXw_AmarNc_mdCKVRrtWR8e4/edit?usp=sharing).\r\n\r\n2. Use the accessibility prompts in the [Prompt Playbook](https://studio.code.org/docs/ide/prompting-playbook/classes/accessibility-prompts) to prompt AI to make fixes to the web app.\r\n\r\n3. Review the AI's output and decide: Did it address the issue clearly and correctly? What would you keep, change, or improve?",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
